      "blocks": {
        "review_1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Tamara I. · Verified buyer",
            "tag_1": "alopecia",
            "tag_2": "non-greasy",
            "quote": "\"I have alopecia and it didn’t feel greasy once applied. From the oil to the scalp massager, 10 out of 10!\"",
            "product": "elaren-pumpkin-seed-oil-regrowth-serum",
            "image_fallback": "https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Joan_Woody.png"
          }
        },
        "review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Emily L. · Verified buyer",
            "tag_1": "healthier scalp",
            "tag_2": "lightweight",
            "quote": "\"My scalp feels noticeably healthier, and it sinks in without that heavy, greasy feeling.\"",
            "product": "elaren-pumpkin-seed-oil-regrowth-serum",
            "text": "<p>I’ve recently been using this pumpkin seed oil, and it works great. The oil itself feels lightweight but still super nourishing, it sinks in without that heavy, greasy feeling that some hair oils leave behind. My scalp feels noticeably healthier and more hydrated, and I’ve had way less dryness since using it.</p><p>I really like the bottle because it makes it easy to get the oil right onto my scalp instead of wasting it on the top of my hair. And the scalp massager that comes with it is surprisingly good, it really helps distribute the oil evenly and gets the circulation going. It feels amazing, honestly.</p><p>I’ve been using it pretty consistently and I can already see a difference in softness and overall shine! Definitely a solid option if your scalp needs a little extra love or you’re trying to strengthen your hair. I’d buy this again.</p>",
            "image_fallback": "https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Karen_Kelly.png"
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Artistry W. · Certified herbalist",
            "tag_1": "herbalist approved",
            "tag_2": "fast absorbing",
            "quote": "\"I’m a certified herbalist and aromatherapist and I trust Elaren as part of my morning routine.\"",
            "product": "elaren-pumpkin-seed-oil-regrowth-serum",
            "text": "<p>I’m a certified herbalist and aromatherapist and trust Elaren for a lot of their pumpkin seed oil products as part of my morning routine. I absolutely love their pumpkin seed oil serum. Has a lovely, earthy scent, and as far as oiliness goes, it’s fast absorbing into the skin. Great value for the cost!</p>",
            "image_fallback": "https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/imagw2.png"
          }
        },
        "review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "HMJ · Verified buyer",
            "tag_1": "hair growth",
            "tag_2": "moisturised scalp",
            "quote": "\"Helps stimulate hair growth and keeps my scalp moisturised. Not too thick and smells great.\"",
            "product": "elaren-pumpkin-seed-oil-regrowth-serum",
            "image_fallback": "https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Lisa.png"
          }
        },
        "review_5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Pat · Verified buyer (UK)",
            "tag_1": "does what it says",
            "tag_2": "recommended to my daughters",
            "quote": "\"It really does what it says. I’ve already told my two daughters to buy it.\"",
            "product": "elaren-pumpkin-seed-oil-regrowth-serum",
            "text": "<p>Have been using this oil for a few weeks and it really does what it says in the advertised article.</p><p>I have already advised my two daughters to purchase the oil. Highly recommend, will be purchasing again.</p><p>– Pat</p>",
            "image_fallback": "https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Sarah_Jane_Frantz.png"
          }
        },
        "review_6": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Verified buyer (US)",
            "tag_1": "wider part",
            "tag_2": "baby hairs",
            "quote": "\"I’ve stopped shedding as much, and I’m seeing fine baby hairs growing in at a decent rate.\"",
            "product": "pumpkin-seed-oil-capsules",
            "text": "<p>My hairdresser told me all about pumpkin seed oil to help with DHT issues. I’ve been on a GLP1 and lost a lot of weight, and she’s had success with a number of her clients who’ve shed hair due to rapid weight loss. My hair still looks normal to everyone else, but I can feel a difference and my part is a bit wider. I love the idea of taking a vitamin rather than slathering product on my scalp, so I was happy to try these. I have been taking them for two months now. (I couldn’t reorder these because they were unavailable, so month two I was using another product.)</p><p>I can definitely see a benefit to these. I’ve stopped shedding as much, and I’m seeing fine baby hairs growing in at a decent rate, so I’d rate these capsules as very effective. The quality of the bottle and the capsules themselves are topnotch and came well secured and safe. There is no aftertaste, and I am enjoying the health benefits of these vitamins. I notice no difference in my energy level, in case that matters.</p>",
            "image_fallback": "https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Iriel_G.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_7": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Roshani55 · Verified buyer",
            "tag_1": "curly hair",
            "tag_2": "third purchase",
            "quote": "\"This is my third purchase. Good for curly hair after wash day.\"",
            "product": "elaren-pumpkin-seed-oil-regrowth-serum",
            "image_fallback": "https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Sarah_M.png"
          }
        },
        "review_8": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Andrea · Verified buyer",
            "tag_1": "thicker feel",
            "tag_2": "less dry scalp",
            "quote": "\"My hair already feels a bit thicker and looks healthier, and my scalp doesn’t feel as dry.\"",
            "product": "pumpkin-seed-oil-capsules",
            "text": "<p>I’ve been using this for a little while and I’m really happy with it so far. The softgels are easy to take and don’t have any weird taste or aftertaste. I like that it’s made with clean, plant-based ingredients like pumpkin seed oil, and that it’s cold-pressed and third-party tested.</p><p>My hair already feels a bit thicker and looks healthier, and my scalp doesn’t feel as dry. It’s nice to find something simple and natural that actually seems to help. Definitely planning to keep this as part of my routine.</p>",
            "image_fallback": "https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/image3.png"
          }
        },
        "review_9": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Kaylene R. · Verified buyer",
            "tag_1": "a little goes a long way",
            "tag_2": "doesn’t stain",
            "quote": "\"It only needs a small amount, spreads well and doesn’t stain.\"",
            "product": "elaren-pumpkin-seed-oil-regrowth-serum",
